nicative situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Formal vs. Informal Language"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use formal words and expressions in some situations, like making reservations or polite requests at a restaurant. You can use modals of request in these situations. <br>  <br>You respond to formal requests in a polite way. If you do not know the person's name, you say Sir, Madam, or Miss.</br>  <br>You use informal or casual words and expressions when you speak to your friends or family.</br>   <br>Remember to be polite!"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":3,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Formal\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Informal\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Making Requests\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Could I \u2026 ?<br> May I \u2026 ?<br> Would you like to \u2026 ?<br> Excuse me \u2026 ?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can I/you \u2026 ?<br> Do you want to \u2026 ?</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Responding to Requests\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\">Certainly, Sir/Madam.<br> Absolutely.<br> You are very welcome.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Sure.<br> No problem.<br> You're welcome.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Hey, can you send the invitations please?<br><span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>: Sure, Ann. No problem."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ann</span>: Excuse me, could I sit by the bar?<br><span class=\"strong\">Waiter</span>: Certainly, Miss. This way, please."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "party "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the number of people in a group  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: There is a party of four under Mr. Smith."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use when you make a reservation."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "at the bar "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the area in a restaurant where you order drinks "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Can we sit at the bar?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "by the window "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a table near the window "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'd like to sit by the window, please."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "You're very welcome"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "when you respond to someone saying thanks "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You're very welcome, Sir."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "certainly "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "yes; of course"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">Nancy</span>: We would like a nice cake. <span class=\"strong\">Derek</span>: Certainly."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "absolutely"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "yes; of course"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adverb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: <span class=\"strong\">Nancy</span>: Could we sit at the bar? <span class=\"strong\">Derek</span>: Absolutely."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob03aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "bartender "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person who works at a bar and makes drinks "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I love to watch the bartenders."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob03aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "farewell "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "parting; when someone is leaving for a long time "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We should have a farewell dinner for Vanessa!"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le08ob03aud08"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le08ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Read the dialogue again."}, {"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, write a dialogue about ordering food at a restaurant. Use polite words and expressions."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice saying the dialogue out loud."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Exchange roles with your partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Share your dialogue with the class."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I write a dialogue about ordering food."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I use formal expressions for ordering at a restaurant."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about food at a restaurant."}]}], "type": "sena"}